<!-- SPECKIT START -->
For additional context about technologies to be used, project structure,
shell commands, and other important information, read the current plan at
`specs/003-rewards-sync-shop/plan.md` (feature: Rewards, Sync & Shop).

Stack: Next.js 16 (App Router, Server Actions) + React 19, Drizzle ORM on libSQL/SQLite,
next-auth 5, @tanstack/react-query, zustand, date-fns-tz, Tailwind v4. App lives in `web/`.
Quality gates: `npm run typecheck` and `npm run lint` (no automated test runner configured).
Key design: optimistic client cache + background server sync via React Query useMutation;
setQueryData/invalidateQueries (no router.refresh in components); SSR initialData hydration;
shared lib/queries/ and lib/mutations/ helpers. This feature adds: server-backed focus countdown
(`focusTargetMinutes` on time_blocks); dual-dropdown allocation (project/habit/task) with 2×/2×/3×
credit bonuses; habit auto-complete on allocated block stop; AM rundown + day-close via React Query
`["amRundown"]` with refetchOnWindowFocus; four active categories only; symbolic shop (850 / 16,500 pts).
See specs/003-rewards-sync-shop/contracts/ for action and UI contracts.
